    rdfs:comment "https://www.six-group.com/en/services/legal/terms-and-conditions/terms-of-use.html — \"The entire content of the SIX website is protected by copyright law. Consequently, presentations, brochures, flyers, graphics, texts, designs, charts, etc., may not be reproduced or reused in any way or used for commercial purposes.\" Used for verification only: the codes and currency assignments were checked against it; no list was taken from it. The per-card evidence cites the single List One entry for that state as a short factual quotation."@en .

<https://style-guide.europa.eu/sv/content/-/isg/topic?identifier=annex-a5-list-countries-territories-currencies>
    dcterms:title "Interinstitutional Style Guide, Annex A5: List of countries, territories and currencies (English and Swedish versions)" ;
    dcterms:creator "Publications Office of the European Union" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    rdfs:comment "https://op.europa.eu/en/web/about-us/legal-notices/publications-office-of-the-european-union-copyright — \"The editorial content of this website, which is owned by the EU, is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence.\" … \"You can reuse it provided you acknowledge the source and indicate any changes you have made.\" The Swedish PDF edition of the guide (ISG_sv_4web.pdf, last updated 30.9.2026) says \"© Europeiska unionen, 2026 … Kopiering tillåten med angivande av källan.\" The guide is used for verification only, so its licence puts no condition on the deck; it is acknowledged here and in the deck's sources all the same."@en .

<https://www.un.org/en/about-us/member-states>
